# Continuous-play rhythm: each fight deliberately compresses time, then hands
# control back through a short acceleration release. The finale is the longest
# pressure window and exits on a clean speed-up instead of another hard stop.
ride_speed_beat|expansion-speed-intro|0.000|12.000|Threat Approach|approach|0.960|-1.000|0.900|1.000|72.000|4.000|4.000|0|1|1|0
ride_speed_beat|expansion-speed-assault|12.000|96.000|Vanguard Combat Hold|combat_hold|0.880|-1.000|0.880|1.180|64.000|6.000|8.000|1|1|1|0
ride_speed_beat|expansion-speed-release-01|96.000|132.000|First Release|release_boost|1.180|-1.000|1.240|1.000|84.000|6.000|8.000|0|1|1|0
ride_speed_beat|expansion-speed-gate|132.000|144.000|Shard Gate Brake|corner_brake|0.840|-1.000|0.820|1.280|58.000|4.000|4.000|2|1|1|0
ride_speed_beat|expansion-speed-sniper|144.000|228.000|Echelon Combat Hold|combat_hold|0.860|-1.000|0.860|1.200|62.000|6.000|8.000|1|1|1|0
ride_speed_beat|expansion-speed-release-02|228.000|264.000|Second Release|release_boost|1.160|-1.000|1.220|1.000|84.000|6.000|8.000|0|1|1|0
ride_speed_beat|expansion-speed-ribs|264.000|276.000|Rib Entry Brake|corner_brake|0.820|-1.000|0.800|1.300|56.000|4.000|4.000|2|1|1|0
ride_speed_beat|expansion-speed-interceptors|276.000|392.000|Ring Finale Hold|combat_hold|0.900|-1.000|0.900|1.180|64.000|8.000|10.000|1|1|1|0
ride_speed_beat|expansion-speed-exit|392.000|480.000|Final Release|exit_boost|1.220|-1.000|1.300|1.000|90.000|10.000|12.000|0|1|1|0

# Difficulty curve: encounter one exposes one attacker, encounter two permits a
# two-part cross-pressure decision, and encounter three sustains three threats.
# Readability requirements rise with pressure so difficulty never comes from
# hiding the tell. These same authored budgets drive encounter-clear rewards.
encounter_beat|expansion-beat-assault|expansion-assault|Vanguard Priority|combat_expansion_assault_v|12.000|96.000|18.000|0.500|1.100|0.650|1.300|1.300|6.200|0.850|2.500|0.720|1|1.250|-|0.780|0.680|2.000|1.200|10|1|0|1|1|0
encounter_beat|expansion-beat-sniper|expansion-sniper|Shard Crossfire|combat_expansion_sniper_echelon|144.000|228.000|12.000|0.450|1.000|0.800|1.500|1.500|7.000|1.000|3.000|0.780|2|2.150|-|0.880|0.800|3.500|2.400|10|1|0|1|1|0
encounter_beat|expansion-beat-interceptor|expansion-interceptor|Homing Ring Finale|combat_expansion_interceptor_ring|276.000|384.000|12.000|0.350|0.800|0.550|1.000|1.400|6.000|1.300|2.500|0.820|3|2.050|-|0.940|0.840|2.500|2.000|10|1|1|1|1|0

