# Encounter 1: staggered V formation teaches target priority.
event|12.000|enemy_wave|combat_expansion_assault_v|V formation: break the lead attacker before the wings commit|expansion-event-assault|1|1

# Encounter 2: the center shard can be destroyed or avoided while the echelon
# sniper asks the player to decide between route safety and an interrupt.
event|132.000|obstacle|combat_shard_gate|break the shard or move around it|expansion-event-shard|1|1
event|144.000|enemy_wave|combat_expansion_sniper_echelon|echelon escort: interrupt the long orange aim|expansion-event-sniper|1|1

# Encounter 3: twin solid ribs compress the safe lane before homing attackers
# dive into a ring, making movement direction and projectile interception matter.
event|264.000|obstacle|combat_lane_rib_left|left rib closes the outside lane|expansion-event-rib-left|1|1
event|264.000|obstacle|combat_lane_rib_right|right rib closes the outside lane|expansion-event-rib-right|1|1
event|276.000|enemy_wave|combat_expansion_interceptor_ring|ring dive: commit to dodge or shoot down homing rounds|expansion-event-interceptor|1|1
